}{\plain \fs24 \f3 Merciful God, creator of all the peoples of the earth and\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 lover of souls: Have compassion on all who do not know you\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 as you are revealed in your Son Jesus Christ; let your Gospel\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 be preached with grace and power to those who have not\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 heard it; turn the hearts of those who resist it; and bring\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 home to your fold those who have gone astray; that there\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 may be one flock under one shepherd, Jesus Christ our Lord.\par
}{\plain \fs24 \i\f3 Amen.}{\plain \fs24 \f3 \par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3  \par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3  \par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 Let us commit ourselves to God, and pray for the grace\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 of a holy life, that, with all who have departed this world and\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 have died in the peace of Christ, and those whose faith is\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 known to God alone, we may be accounted worthy to enter\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 into the fullness of the joy of our Lord, and receive the crown\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 of life in the day of resurrection.\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 \par
}{\plain \fs20 \i\f3\fs20 Silence}{\plain \fs24 \f3 \par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 \par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 O God of unchangeable power and eternal light: Look\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 favorably on your whole Church, that wonderful and sacred \par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 mystery; by the effectual working of your providence, carry\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 out in tranquility the plan of salvation; let the whole world \par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 see and know that things which were cast down are being\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 raised up, and things which had grown old are being made\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 new, and that all things are being brought to their perfection\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 by him through whom all things were made, your Son Jesus\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 Christ our Lord; who lives and reigns with you, in the unity\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 of the Holy Spirit, one God, for ever and ever.  =Amen.=\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3  \par
